WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.322
Functions reduce repetition and make analytical code easier to manage.

00:00:05.322 --> 00:00:10.937
Without functions, the same formula may be copied into several places.

00:00:10.937 --> 00:00:15.652
If the rule changes later, every copy has to be updated.

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:19.338
With a function, the logic has one clear home.

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:23.005
A name such as get_profit also communicates intent.

00:00:23.005 --> 00:00:31.520
It tells the reader what the code is supposed to do before they even inspect the details.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:37.632
Functions are also easier to test because each small unit can be checked independently.
